		font-size: 22px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #f8fafc;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}
	.hero-sub {
		font-size: 13px;
		color: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.78);
		line-height: 20px;
	}
